{"version":1,"content":"<p><strong>NVIDIA 黃仁勳預言：未來每部車都將搭載 AI　汽車競爭從馬力轉向算力</strong></p><p>黃仁勳在CES 2026預言未來每部車將搭載AI，汽車競爭從馬力轉向算力。輝達發布Alpamayo自駕AI模型，定位全球首款能思考推理的自動駕駛系統，並與Mercedes-Benz合作推進L4級自動駕駛車隊。</p><p>暫時未能從Unwire擷取全文。</p><p><a href=\"https://unwire.hk/2026/06/06/jensen-huang-ai-compute-power-cars-future/life-tech/auto/?utm_source=rss&amp;utm_medium=rss&amp;utm_campaign=jensen-huang-ai-compute-power-cars-future\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">閱讀原文</a></p>","scraped_at":"2026-06-06T03:23:33.239005+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":164,"images":0,"source":"Unwire","fallback":"minimal"}}